// spec: 004.14-throws
// probe: negative-must-fail
// untyped `throws` 는 `throws (any Error)` — Error 를 구현하지 않은 값은 던질 수 없다.
// expect-error: is not covered by the enclosing function's `throws (any

struct Plain { x: i32; }
fn f() throws -> i32 { throw Plain { x: 1 }; }
println(f"{try f() catch _ { 0 }}");
